      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at flooring options for a high-traffic commercial lobby for a law firm in London. Can you do a quick comparison between polished concrete, LVT (luxury vinyl tile), and natural stone? Specifically looking at maintenance requirements and long-term wear resistance.",
